# IAAI experiment scratch: regenerated PO + per-condition scan outputs
docs/IAAI_Manuscript/experiments/work/

# IAAI experiments: client-derived corpora and per-row results stay LOCAL.
# The repo is public; project002 source text, the client's glossary and
# their hand-written style rules are proprietary. Scripts and aggregate
# findings are committed so the work is reproducible by anyone WITH the
# corpus, without republishing the corpus itself.
docs/IAAI_Manuscript/experiments/data/
docs/IAAI_Manuscript/experiments/results/*.json
docs/IAAI_Manuscript/experiments/results/*.log
# Write-ups quote game strings and locked glossary terms verbatim as
# evidence (that is what makes them evidence). Unreleased game content
# does not belong on a public remote; these stay local until the client
# clears what may appear in the published paper.
docs/IAAI_Manuscript/experiments/FINDINGS.md
docs/IAAI_Manuscript/DRAFT_experimental_sections.md
docs/IAAI_Manuscript/EXPERIMENT_STATUS.md
